# --- one-time crawl/ingestion artifacts -------------------------------
# Source data already loaded into Neon (product_rules, doc_chunks, etc).
# Not read by the running app -- excluded to keep the deploy repo clean.
# (caleitc_table_2025.json is the one exception: load_income_content.py
# reads it directly, so it's intentionally NOT matched by these patterns.)
*_full.txt
*_rules.json
*_phase*.json
tmp_*
dft_*.txt
ersr_*.txt
hstr_*.txt
mvft_*.txt
osrpr_*.txt
out_uftr_*.txt
pmtsr_*.txt
tut_*.txt
uls_*.txt
lpar*.txt
medium_batch*
small_batch*
cannabis_batch*.json
*_txt/
dcc_retailers_raw.json
local_rates_raw.json
docs_dump.txt
banning_survey.txt
berkeley_pdf.txt
*.html
*.pdf
*.log

# --- regenerable sweep/eval result caches -----------------------------
# Rebuilt automatically by their own scripts (item_sweep.py, etc.) --
# committing them just creates permanent-history diff noise.
*_results.json
